flowchart TB
    subgraph HM[Human Motor Intelligence — Umbrella Research-Orchestration Layer]
        REG[Research Registry\nprojects • datasets • protocols • models • experiments/runs • artifacts]
        CONTRACTS[Versioned Contracts\nsignal/provenance • representation • intent • control • artifacts]
        GOV[Scientific Governance\nimmutable protocols • leakage guards • subject-level inference • provenance]
        BENCH[Benchmark & Report Engine\nmetrics • statistics • tables • figures • manifests]
        ROS[Local Research-OS\nregistry navigation • doctor • integrity • manifest verification]
        PUB[Public Review Surface\nREADME • evidence matrix • limitations • manuscripts • release records]
    end

    subgraph CHILD[Independent Child Projects — Not Vendored]
        MC[MyoControl\nEMG motor-intent decoding]
        MA[MyoAdapt\nLOSO / domain adaptation]
        BF[BioSignal-FM\nmultimodal representation platform]
        MS[MyoSim\nsoftware-only virtual control simulation]
    end

    DATA[(Authorized External Data\nmetadata registered; raw recordings remain external)]
    P4[P4 OpenBMI\nreal external EEG validation]
    P5[P5 Jeong\nreal external EEG–EMG validation]
    FIXTURE[P6 R2 Integration Fixture\nsynthetic-demo / example-decoder-v1]
    P3GATE{{P3 Gate\noriginal author package pending}}
    P6GATE{{P6 R3 Gate\nauthenticated three-trace manifest pending}}

    DATA --> REG
    REG --> GOV
    GOV --> CONTRACTS
    CONTRACTS --> BENCH
    REG --> ROS
    GOV --> PUB
    BENCH --> PUB

    MC --> CONTRACTS
    MA --> CONTRACTS
    BF --> CONTRACTS
    CONTRACTS --> MS
    MS --> BENCH

    DATA --> P4
    DATA --> P5
    P4 --> BENCH
    P5 --> BENCH
    FIXTURE --> CONTRACTS
    FIXTURE --> MS
    P3GATE -. no execution without provenance .-> BENCH
    P6GATE -. no decoder-quality benchmark without authenticated traces .-> MS

